# - the exam officer log is append-only: who named or ended whom is never rewritten;
# - the slip print log is append-only: who printed which class, and when;
# - an exam PIN is only ever cancelled: once, naming the print that did it, and
#   nothing else about it changes, nor is it ever deleted.
#
